# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Apophis-PptxSmith 仓库忽略规则
# 原则：决策与研究文本（research/*.md、.scratch/**）必须入库；
#       实验二进制与运行产物不入库，由 manifest 记录 sha256 复现。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Spike / 实验产物 -------------------------------------------------------
# 两类产物，处理方式不同：
#   A) 可由脚本一条命令重建的 → 不入库，只留脚本 + hash 清单
#   B) 作为证据被报告直接引用的 → 入库（体积小且是结论的支撑）
#
# A 类：spike-D fixture 五件材料（generate_fixtures.py 可确定性重建，
# 已实测三轮 hash 一致）。manifest 记录 sha256，见 spike-D-fixtures/README.md。
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.docx
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.xlsx
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.pptx
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.pdf
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.ttf
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.otf
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.ttc
research/experiments/spike-D-fixtures/*.norm

# B 类保留（勿加排除规则，否则报告引用的证据会消失）：
#   research/experiments/spike-E/          ← A 级语义验收的产物与渲染证据
#   research/experiments/sandun-raw/covers/ ← 四份案例封面（视觉取证实物）
#   research/experiments/sandun-raw/slides-svg/ ← 页面 SVG 源码

# 通用规则：任何实验目录下的临时/归一化中间文件都不入库
research/experiments/**/*.norm
research/experiments/**/.nested-*
research/experiments/**/*.tmp

# --- 用户材料与交付物 -------------------------------------------------------
# 用 /* 而非整体目录模式：整体忽略后 Git 不会下降进目录，! 例外将失效
input/*
output/*
!input/.gitkeep
!output/.gitkeep

# --- 运行时与构建产物 -------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
target/
bin/
obj/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- 环境与密钥（严禁入库） -------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials/

# --- 编辑器与系统 -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- 本地临时 ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
